// A vertical tab, a form feed, a field separator, or a unicode space
// at the start of a suggestion does not fill the line cap.
// A break after that mark still ends the line.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE room ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG room law

IMPULSE room 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "room" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
